    "inherent": "moderate",
    "residual": "moderate",
    "forecast": "moderate",
    "rationale": "Present risk is driven by repudiation rather than outsider injection: only trusted on-call engineers can access the assistant, but production actions are executed under the engineer's personal token and logged only as if the engineer acted directly. Because the only linkage between request and action is deletable chat history, attribution is weak for both deployments and irreversible migrations. Declared controls are access restriction and detective logging only; they do not sever or materially narrow the repudiation path, so residual remains moderate. Forecast remains moderate because the named controls do not currently lower the tier."
  },
